#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:97
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Mabalin a mangtignay dagiti kontak iti maysa nga aramid babaen ti "
"panangipatulodda iti nalimed a mensahe ti SMS. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba "
"ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:100
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr "Mabalin a kiddawen dagiti mapagtalkan a kontak ti lokasionmo babaen ti panangipatulodda iti nalimed nga SMS message. Obligado ti TOTP tapno aggana daytoy a tampok. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da. Kas pagarigan a template: 'SECRET TOTP' Aktual a pagarigan: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:103
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr "Mabalin a siuulimek a mangtignay dagiti mapagtalkan a kontak iti callback babaen ti panangipatulodda iti nalimed nga SMS message. Obligado ti TOTP tapno aggana daytoy a tampok. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da. Kas pagarigan a template: 'SECRET TOTP' Aktual a pagarigan: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:106
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr "Mabalin a mangipatulod dagiti mapagtalkan a kontak iti SMS relay. Obligado ti TOTP tapno aggana daytoy a tampok. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da. Kas pagarigan a template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Aktual a pagarigan: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:109
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr "Dagiti mapagtalkan a kontak ket mabalinda a rugian ti tmate a sesion ti SSH ken umawat ti kuerdas ti panagserrek ti SSH babaen ti panangipatulod ti nalimed a mensahe ti SMS. Obligado ti TOTP tapno aggana daytoy a tampok. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da. Kas pagarigan a template: 'SECRET TOTP' Aktual a pagarigan: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:112
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr "Mabalinda a punasen dagiti mapagtalkan a kontak ti alikamenmo. Obligado ti TOTP tapno aggana daytoy a tampok. Inayon dagiti kontak iti baba ken i-set ti nalimed a trigger phrase-da. Kas pagarigan a template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Aktual a pagarigan: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

